---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Matteo Sacco | Développeur Fullstack">
  <section class="py-4 md:py-8">
    <div class="mb-10 opacity-0 animate-fade-in">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-accent-400 mb-4">
        Bienvenue
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-4">
        <span class="text-zinc-100">Matteo Sacco</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-zinc-400 font-light max-w-2xl">
        Alternant ingénieur informatique, passionné par le développement web fullstack et le Design.
      </p>
      <a
        href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/cv-sacco-matteo.pdf`}
        target="_blank"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-6 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium rounded-xl bg-accent-500/10 border border-accent-400/30 text-accent-400 hover:bg-accent-500/20 transition-all duration-200"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" />
        </svg>
        Télécharger mon CV
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="group opacity-0 animate-fade-in-delay-1 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/50 bg-zinc-900/30 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent-400/30 hover:bg-zinc-800/20">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-100 mb-2">Qui suis-je</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          23 ans, basé à Reims. En recherche d'une alternance passionnante pour mettre en pratique mes compétences et acquérir de nouvelles connaissances.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group opacity-0 animate-fade-in-delay-2 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/50 bg-zinc-900/30 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent-400/30 hover:bg-zinc-800/20">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-100 mb-2">Ce qui m'inspire</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          Découvrir de nouveaux langages, explorer de nouvelles approches. Toujours curieux, toujours ouvert aux nouvelles méthodes de travail.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group opacity-0 animate-fade-in-delay-3 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/50 bg-zinc-900/30 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent-400/30 hover:bg-zinc-800/20">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-100 mb-2">Mes passions</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          L'histoire, les jeux vidéo, et surtout l'informatique sous toutes ses formes. Membre de l'association Cap'Arden, amateur de 4x4 et de nature.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
